[en.DECISION_C02_C06_SOUTH]
Send troops to stabilize Eastern Equestria

[en.DECISION_C02_C06_SOUTH_desc]
The Empire has asked us to send troops to Eastern Equestria to stabilize the region. This is a test of our loyalty to the Empire — as our goal is to stop Starlight Glimmer from further controlling the region.

[zh.DECISION_C02_C06_SOUTH]
出兵稳定东小马利亚

[zh.DECISION_C02_C06_SOUTH_desc]
帝国已经要求我们派遣军队到东小马利亚稳定该地区。这是对我们对帝国的忠诚的一次考验——因为我们的目标是阻止星光熠熠进一步控制该地区。
